{"schema":1,"locale":"zh-Hans","created_at":"2026-11-28T14:17:33.001Z","entries":{"docs-7.24\u0000## routing/ospf/static-neighbor **Type:** Directory":"## routing/ospf/static-neighbor \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/pimsm **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## routing/pimsm \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/pimsm/bsr **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## routing/pimsm/bsr \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/pimsm/bsr/rp-candidate **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## routing/pimsm/bsr/rp-candidate \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/pimsm/bsr/rp-set **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## routing/pimsm/bsr/rp-set \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/pimsm/igmp-interface-template **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## routing/pimsm/igmp-interface-template \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/pimsm/instance **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## routing/pimsm/instance \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/pimsm/interface **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## routing/pimsm/interface \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/pimsm/interface-template **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## routing/pimsm/interface-template \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/pimsm/neighbor **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## routing/pimsm/neighbor \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/pimsm/static-rp **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## routing/pimsm/static-rp \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/pimsm/uib-g **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## routing/pimsm/uib-g \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/pimsm/uib-sg **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## routing/pimsm/uib-sg \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/rip/interface **Type:** Directory":"## routing/rip/interface \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000Static configuration of the OSPF neighbors. Required for non-broadcast multi-access networks.":"OSPF 邻居的静态配置。非广播多路访问网络必需。","docs-7.24\u0000The instance menu defines the main PIM-SM settings. The instance is then used for all other PIM-related configurations like interface-template, static RP, and Bootstrap Router.":"instance 菜单用于定义 PIM-SM 的主要设置。该实例随后用于所有其他 PIM 相关配置，例如 interface-template、static RP 和 Bootstrap Router。","docs-7.24\u0000The interface menu shows all interfaces that are currently participating in PIM and their statuses. This menu contains dynamic and read-only entries that get created by defined interface templates.":"interface 菜单显示当前参与 PIM 的所有接口及其状态。该菜单包含由已定义接口模板创建的动态只读条目。","docs-7.24\u0000The interface template menu defines which interfaces will participate in PIM and what per-interface configuration will be used.":"接口模板菜单定义哪些接口将参与 PIM，以及将使用哪些每接口配置。","docs-7.24\u0000The neighbor menu shows all detected neighbors that are running PIM and their statuses. This menu contains dynamic and read-only entries.":"neighbor 菜单显示所有检测到的、运行 PIM 的邻居及其状态。该菜单包含动态且只读的条目。","docs-7.24\u0000The static-rp menu allows manually defining the multicast group to RP mappings. Such a mechanism is not robust to failures but does at least provide a basic interoperability mechanism.":"static-rp 菜单用于手动定义组播组到 RP 的映射。该机制对故障不具备鲁棒性，但至少提供了一种基本的互操作机制。","docs-7.24\u0000The upstream information base menus show the any-source multicast(\\*,G) and source-specific multicast(S,G) groups and their statuses. These menus contain only read-only entries.":"上游信息库菜单显示任意源组播（\\*,G）和指定源组播（S,G）组及其状态。这些菜单仅包含只读条目。"}}
